Z||000007||Daleford||11-26-2001||07:47 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by PBJ:<BR><B>Part way through a 4.9 swap, I am budgeting for $1000.00 in parts and am doing the labour myself.  Have a 86 GT to begin with.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>What he said! I am in about the same position as PBJ with about the same amount of money spent. }Don't tell the cops but I have actually test run up and down the street a few times.} <BR>For the $1000 that some people spend on an "adapter", I'm crusin' already!!<BR>When there are perfect modern V-8's out there that bolt up, why use one that doesn't?<BR><P>------------------<BR>||||reg||14
Z||000008||fastback87||11-26-2001||02:12 PM||||Which modern V8's fit as a direct bolt on to the tranny?  This is the first I have heard of this...Tell me more...Please.||||reg||1
